  "body": "Step into a residence where every detail has been crafted to enrich the lives of a growing family. Set on a freehold 462m² (approx.) flat section with an impressive 280m² (approx.) floor area, spanning 5 generous bedrooms and 4.5 thoughtfully appointed bathrooms, this exceptional home offers the perfect blend of space, sophistication, and versatility. Covered by the balance of 10-Year Master Builder Guarantee for complete peace of mind.\r\n\r\nGround Floor – Versatility & Welcome\r\nThe ground level is a testament to smart design, featuring a welcoming living room ideal for both lively gatherings and quiet evenings. The spacious master suite on this floor is perfect for guests or extended family, ensuring everyone has their own haven.\r\n\r\nGourmet Kitchens – Culinary Excellence\r\nAt the heart of the home, a chic European-style kitchen inspires culinary creativity, while the adjoining butler’s kitchen adds functionality and ease—making daily meals and entertaining seamless. Internal-access double garaging provides security and convenience for busy family life.\r\n\r\nUpstairs Sanctuary – Rest & Rejuvenation\r\nClimb the stairs to discover four additional bedrooms, including two luxurious master suites, offering privacy and comfort for every family member. The central family lounge invites relaxation, connection, and cozy movie nights in a peaceful setting.\r\n\r\nLight, Space & Seamless Indoor-Outdoor Living\r\nBathed in natural light, the expansive living area flows effortlessly to a low-maintenance deck and lush green lawn. Imagine morning coffees in the sun, weekend barbecues, or simply unwinding in your private garden oasis. Here, the boundary between indoors and outdoors is beautifully blurred, creating a sense of openness and tranquility.\r\n\r\nPrime Location – Coastal Tranquility Meets Urban Convenience\r\nNestled in one of Auckland’s most prestigious coastal suburbs, you’re just moments from the golden sands of Long Bay Beach and scenic nature reserves. Everyday essentials are at your fingertips with local supermarkets and village shops nearby. Families will value the prestigious Decile 10 school zone, including Long Bay Primary, Northcross Intermediate, and Long Bay College—all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the serenity of coastal living with the convenience of a quick 30-minute commute to Auckland’s vibrant CBD. This is a rare opportunity to secure your family’s future in a home that truly has it all.\r\n\r\nExperience the perfect balance of comfort, elegance, and location. Contact us today to arrange your viewing and make this exceptional residence your new family sanctuary.",
